#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:2
msgid "URL versioning schemes"
msgstr "URL 版本控制方案"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:4
msgid ""
"The URL versioning scheme of your project defines the URL of your "
"documentation, and if your project supports multiple versions or "
"translations."
msgstr "项目的 URL 版本控制方案决定文档的 URL，以及项目是否支持多版本或多翻译。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:7
msgid "Read the Docs supports three different versioning schemes:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 支持三种不同的版本控制方案："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:9
msgid "`Multiple versions with translations`_."
msgstr "`Multiple versions with translations`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:10
msgid "`Multiple versions without translations`_."
msgstr "`Multiple versions without translations`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:11
msgid "`Single version without translations`_."
msgstr "`Single version without translations`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:15
msgid ":doc:`/versions`"
msgstr ":doc:`/versions`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:16
msgid "General explanation of how versioning works on Read the Docs."
msgstr "Read the Docs 上版本控制如何工作的总体说明。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:18
msgid ":doc:`/url-path-prefixes`"
msgstr ":doc:`/url-path-prefixes`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:19
msgid "Customize the URL structure of your documentation with custom path prefixes."
msgstr "用自定义路径前缀定制文档的 URL 结构。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:22
msgid "Multiple versions with translations"
msgstr "多版本带翻译"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:24
msgid ""
"This is the default versioning scheme, it's the recommend one if your "
"project has multiple versions, and has or plans to support translations."
msgstr "这是默认的版本控制方案，若项目有多个版本且已支持或计划支持翻译，推荐使用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:27
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:40
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:59
msgid "The URLs of your documentation will look like:"
msgstr "文档 URL 形式如下："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:29
msgid "``/en/latest/``"
msgstr "``/en/latest/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:30
msgid "``/en/1.5/``"
msgstr "``/en/1.5/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:31
msgid "``/es/latest/install.html``"
msgstr "``/es/latest/install.html``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:32
msgid "``/es/1.5/contributing.html``"
msgstr "``/es/1.5/contributing.html``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:35
msgid "Multiple versions without translations"
msgstr "多版本不带翻译"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:37
msgid ""
"Use this versioning scheme if you want to have multiple versions of your "
"documentation, but don't want to have translations."
msgstr "若想有多个文档版本但不想要翻译，使用此版本控制方案。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:42
msgid "``/latest/``"
msgstr "``/latest/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:43
msgid "``/1.5/install.html``"
msgstr "``/1.5/install.html``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:47
msgid "This means you can't have translations for your documentation."
msgstr "这意味着文档不能有翻译。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:50
msgid "Single version without translations"
msgstr "单版本不带翻译"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:52
msgid ""
"Having a single version of a documentation project can be considered the "
"better choice in cases where there should only always exist one unambiguous "
"copy of your project. For example:"
msgstr "在项目应始终只存在一份无歧义副本的情况下，单版本文档项目是更合适的选择。例如："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:56
msgid ""
"A research project may wish to *only* expose readers to their latest list of"
" publications and research data."
msgstr "研究项目可能希望*仅* 向读者展示其最新的论文与研究数据列表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:57
msgid ""
"A :abbr:`SaaS (Software as a Service)` application might only ever have one "
"version live."
msgstr ":abbr:`SaaS (Software as a Service)` 应用可能永远只有一个线上版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:61
msgid "``/``"
msgstr "``/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:62
msgid "``/install.html``"
msgstr "``/install.html``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:66
msgid ""
"This means you can't have translations or multiple versions for your "
"documentation."
msgstr "这意味着文档不能有翻译或多个版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:69
msgid "How to change the URL versioning scheme of your project"
msgstr "如何更改项目的 URL 版本控制方案"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:71
msgid ""
"Changing the versioning scheme of your project will affect the URLs of your "
"documentation, any existing links to your documentation will break. If you "
"want to keep the old URLs working, you can create :doc:`redirects </user-"
"defined-redirects>`."
msgstr ""
"更改项目的版本控制方案会影响文档 URL，现有的文档链接都会失效。若想保持旧 URL 可用，可创建 :doc:`重定向 </user-defined-"
"redirects>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:75
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:76
msgid ""
"Select the new versioning scheme in the :guilabel:`URL versioning scheme` "
"dropdown."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`URL versioning scheme` 下拉框中选择新的版本控制方案。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/versioning-schemes.rst:77
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Save` 。"

